@startuml
[*] --> Idle_State

Idle_State --> Channel_Selected : User selects channel
Channel_Selected --> Content_Updated : User updates content
Content_Updated --> Updating_Channels : System updates all channels
Updating_Channels --> Idle_State : Updates complete
Updating_Channels --> Error_State : Update fails

Error_State --> Idle_State : Error handled

Idle_State --> [*]
@enduml
